#!/bin/bash
# Clawputer launcher (CardputerZero).
# Shows the GUI mode screen (first run: install Claude Code + sign in), then runs Claude where
# you picked: on this Cardputer (chat GUI), on your PC over SSH (chat GUI), or the terminal.
# The only terminal bits are the RAM-boost password prompt and its reboot.
SHARE=/usr/share/clawputer
CONF="$HOME/.config/clawputer"; mkdir -p "$CONF"
GUI="$SHARE/clawputer_gui.py"
WARN="$CONF/esc_warning"
BOOST=/usr/local/sbin/clawputer-boost
BOOTMODE=/usr/local/sbin/clawputer-bootmode
CLAUDE="$HOME/.local/bin/claude"; [ -x "$CLAUDE" ] || CLAUDE=$(command -v claude || echo "$CLAUDE")
TMUX_SOCK=clawputer

gpu_mb(){ vcgencmd get_mem gpu 2>/dev/null | tr -dc 0-9; }
boost_ok(){ [ -x "$BOOST" ] && sudo -n -l "$BOOST" on >/dev/null 2>&1; }
flush_keys(){ while read -rsn1 -t 0.05 _; do :; done; }

show_warning(){
  [ -f "$WARN" ] || return 0
  clear; echo "heads up:"; cat "$WARN"; echo
  echo "next time use ctrl+q / /exit to quit,"
  echo "not holding esc."
  rm -f "$WARN"; read -rsn1 -t 20 -p "any key..." _; echo
}

LPID=
resume_launcher(){ [ -n "$LPID" ] && kill -CONT "$LPID" 2>/dev/null; LPID=; }

# full-screen gui with the launcher paused (its status bar would draw over it)
run_gui(){
  sleep 0.3; printf '\033[?25l'; clear
  PYTHONPATH="$SHARE" python3 "$GUI" "$@" < /dev/null 2>>"$CONF/gui.log" &
  local gp=$!
  LPID=$(pgrep -o -f M5CardputerZero-APPLaunch)
  if [ -n "$LPID" ]; then
    # safety net: unpause the launcher when the gui ends, even if this script is killed
    setsid bash -c "while [ -e /proc/$gp ] && ! grep -q '^State:.*Z' /proc/$gp/status 2>/dev/null; do sleep 1; done; kill -CONT $LPID" \
      >/dev/null 2>&1 < /dev/null &
    sleep 0.5; kill -STOP "$LPID" 2>/dev/null
  fi
  wait "$gp"
  resume_launcher
  printf '\033[?25h'; flush_keys
}

# ---------------- stage 2: run Claude (inside tmux for terminal mode) ----------------
if [ "${CLAWPUTER_STAGE:-}" = run ]; then
  GUARD=; HUPPED=
  restore(){
    trap - EXIT HUP TERM INT
    resume_launcher; printf '\033[?25h'
    [ -n "$GUARD" ] && kill "$GUARD" 2>/dev/null
    if [ -n "${CLAWPUTER_BOOST:-}" ]; then
      echo "restoring..."
      systemctl --user start pipewire.socket pipewire-pulse.socket wireplumber 2>/dev/null
      sudo -n "$BOOST" off
    fi
    if [ -n "$HUPPED" ]; then
      { echo "clawputer was force-closed (held esc)."
        [ -n "${CLAWPUTER_BOOST:-}" ] && echo "everything was put back."
        [ "$(gpu_mb)" -le 16 ] 2>/dev/null && echo "low gpu memory + camera off until a reboot."; } > "$WARN"
      exit 0
    fi
    if [ "$(gpu_mb)" -le 16 ] 2>/dev/null && boost_ok; then
      echo; echo "reboot back to normal?"; echo "(gives gpu memory back"; echo " + turns camera on) y/n"
      if read -rsn1 -t 30 k && { [ "$k" = y ] || [ "$k" = Y ]; }; then
        echo "rebooting..."; sudo -n "$BOOTMODE" exit; sleep 60
      fi
    fi
    exit 0
  }
  trap restore EXIT
  trap 'HUPPED=1; exit' HUP TERM

  if [ -n "${CLAWPUTER_BOOST:-}" ]; then
    echo "freeing ram..."
    systemctl --user stop xdg-desktop-portal xdg-desktop-portal-gtk xdg-desktop-portal-wlr \
      xdg-document-portal xdg-permission-store mpris-proxy filter-chain 'gvfs-*' \
      wireplumber pipewire-pulse pipewire pipewire.socket pipewire-pulse.socket 2>/dev/null
    sudo -n "$BOOST" on
    ME=$$
    setsid bash -c "while [ -e /proc/$ME ] && ! grep -q '^State:.*Z' /proc/$ME/status 2>/dev/null; do sleep 2; done
      systemctl --user start pipewire.socket pipewire-pulse.socket wireplumber
      sudo -n $BOOST off
      printf 'clawputer was force-closed.\neverything was put back.\n' > '$WARN'" >/dev/null 2>&1 < /dev/null &
    GUARD=$!
  fi
  export DISABLE_AUTOUPDATER=1 CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_NONESSENTIAL_TRAFFIC=1 CLAWPUTER_CHECKED=1
  mkdir -p "$HOME/clawputer"; cd "$HOME/clawputer" || exit 1
  if [ "${CLAWPUTER_UI:-}" = gui ]; then
    run_gui "$@"
  else
    "$CLAUDE" "$@"
  fi
  exit 0
fi

# ---------------- stage 1: mode screen ----------------
clear; echo "starting clawputer..."
show_warning
AFTER=
while true; do
  rm -f "$CONF/choice"
  CLAWPUTER_AFTER="$AFTER" run_gui --menu
  AFTER=
  CHOICE=$(cat "$CONF/choice" 2>/dev/null || echo quit)
  case "$CHOICE" in
    boost-setup|boost-setup-local)
      clear
      echo "== RAM boost setup =="
      echo "installs 2 small helpers so clawputer"
      echo "can pause background services while"
      echo "claude runs (undo any time). enter"
      echo "your password:"
      echo
      if sudo "$SHARE/boost/enable-boost.sh"; then
        echo "done."; [ "$CHOICE" = boost-setup-local ] && AFTER=local
      else
        echo "not enabled."
      fi
      sleep 1; continue;;
    reboot)
      clear; echo "rebooting with more ram..."; echo "open Clawputer again after it restarts."
      sleep 2; sudo -n "$BOOTMODE" enter; sleep 60; exit 0;;
    local|pc|terminal) break;;
    *) clear; exit 0;;
  esac
done

if [ "$CHOICE" = pc ]; then
  export CLAWPUTER_REMOTE=1 CLAUDE_REMOTE=1 CLAWPUTER_CHECKED=1
  run_gui; exit 0
fi

boost_ok && export CLAWPUTER_BOOST=1
export CLAWPUTER_STAGE=run
if [ "$CHOICE" = terminal ]; then
  export CLAWPUTER_UI=terminal
  exec tmux -L "$TMUX_SOCK" -f "$SHARE/tmux.conf" new-session -A -s clawputer "$0" "$@"
fi
export CLAWPUTER_UI=gui
exec "$0" "$@"
